# Hold on the stock one-player rider-select frontend while the host-side
# Modern profile acceptance drives F2/create/rename through real desktop input.
# After the host panel closes, the acceptance-only host hook queues the ordinary
# guest A edge on an observed rider-select frame so the test can prove the
# selected Modern identity reached stock rider init without wall-clock racing.

until 009F == D7 3600
wait 60
press a 2

until 009F == 3C 1200
wait 60
dump profile-panel-rider-select-ready

until 009F == 6D 2400
wait 60
dump profile-panel-tour-ready
quit
